WEBVTT

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.945 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>Fishing industry suppresses it:
"Industrial disease."</c>

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.778 position:90% line:65% align:right
<c.Lorraine>Yeah, but it's just one man.
We don't even know what happened.</c>

00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:06.778 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>Just one man on video.</c>

00:00:07.491 --> 00:00:10.105 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>Not everyone has the foresight
to die in front of a camera.</c>

00:00:10.191 --> 00:00:11.496 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>The ones we don't see
worry me.</c>

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:14.206 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>Fish is shipped
all over the world from there.</c>

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:17.480 position:30% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>How many people read your paper
over a plate of sushi every day?</c>

00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:20.319 position:90% line:65% align:right
<c.Lorraine>Alan, we have almost
no freelance budget anymore,</c>

00:00:20.397 --> 00:00:22.200 position:90% line:80% align:right
<c.Lorraine>and after H1 ended up--</c>

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.587 position:30% line:65% align:left
<c.Alan>you wait...a few days, 
this will be tweeted and YouTubed
all over the planet.</c>

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.587 position:90% line:80% align:right
<c.Lorraine>We don't want to be the paper 
that cries wolf.</c>

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.100 position:90% line:85% align:right
<c.Lorraine>I'll show it to Hobart.
He does our health stuff now.</c>

00:00:31.432 --> 00:00:33.100 position:40% line:75% align:left
<c.Alan>Are you going to give him
 my story?</c>

00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:35.166 position:40% line:80% align:left
<c.Alan>You're going to give him
my story, aren't you, Lorraine?</c>

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:37.100 position:90% line:80% align:right
<c.Lorraine>No, Alan, I'm trying
to help you.</c>

00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:39.100 position:90% line:80% align:right
<c.Lorraine>It's just one man on a bus.</c>

00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:39.100 position:40% line:70% align:left
<c.Alan>I taped this meeting.</c>

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.800 position:90% line:80% align:right
<c.Lorraine>We need more information
than that.</c>

00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:43.647 line:80%
<c.Alan>This story runs
in the Chronicle,
I will sue your ass!</c>